“ERI is low and momentum is declining” → Friction or Risk Zone

This is highly actionable for CX teams and decisive for prioritization.

3. It surfaces white space vs. diminishing returns:
- High saturation + high momentum = Optimize
- Low saturation + high momentum = Expand & capture growth
- Low saturation + low momentum = Fix foundational blockers
- High saturation + low momentum = Avoid overinvestment — mature zone

No other module delivers this type of loyalty signal-to-noise clarity.

✅ Formal Specification: QSSI – Quantified Signal Strength Index

Definition: QSSI measures the intensity and urgency of a behavioral signal by combining directional velocity with emotional headroom.

🔧 Part 1: Velocity Score (0–6 points)
Captures trend directionality × momentum velocity.

